---
title: "Home"
description: "Design a clearer home using civica.uk styles, components and patterns."
---
<section class="c-hero"><div class="c-container c-hero__inner"><div><h1>Design your home using civica.uk styles, components and patterns</h1><p>Make Home Assistant clear, consistent and easier to use. Start with established public service design, adapted for the devices, information and everyday tasks in your home.</p><a class="c-start-button" href="<%= docs_path('/get-started/index.html') %>">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">❯</span></a></div><img src="<%= docs_path('/images/design-system-hero.svg') %>" alt="" width="420" height="350"></div></section>
<section class="c-whats-new"><div class="c-container"><h2>What’s new</h2><div class="c-home-columns"><div><h3>11 November 2026: complete cards and native task guidance</h3><p>Explore <a href="<%= docs_path('/components/cards.html') %>">14 complete card examples</a>, including image cards and missing states. Use the <a href="<%= docs_path('/home-assistant/index.html') %>">30 Home Assistant specifications</a> for device controls and household tasks.</p><p><a href="<%= docs_path('/community/guidance-work-package.html') %>">Read the fixes and verification record</a></p></div><div><h3>Follow the project</h3><p>Read release notes and follow changes in the public repository.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/nathcymru/HA-Theme-gov.uk/releases">View releases on GitHub</a></p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="c-container c-home-categories" aria-label="Explore the design system">
<article><img src="<%= docs_path('/images/category-styles.svg') %>" alt="" width="320" height="140"><h2><a href="<%= docs_path('/styles/index.html') %>">Styles</a></h2><p>Use colour, typography, spacing and imagery to create a recognisable, accessible interface.</p><ul><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/styles/colour.html') %>">Colour and ten brand palettes</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/styles/chart-colour.html') %>">Chart colours</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/content/index.html') %>">Writing for home automation</a></li></ul></article>
<article><img src="<%= docs_path('/images/category-components.svg') %>" alt="" width="320" height="140"><h2><a href="<%= docs_path('/components/index.html') %>">Components</a></h2><p>Build with reusable elements, from buttons and forms to device cards and charts.</p><ul><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/components/buttons.html') %>">Buttons</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/components/cards.html') %>">Cards</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/components/example.html') %>">Example component</a></li></ul></article>
<article><img src="<%= docs_path('/images/category-patterns.svg') %>" alt="" width="320" height="140"><h2><a href="<%= docs_path('/patterns/index.html') %>">Patterns</a></h2><p>Combine components to help people complete common tasks and understand their home.</p><ul><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/patterns/home.html') %>">Home and rooms</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/patterns/question-pages.html') %>">Question pages and dialogs</a></li><li><a href="<%= docs_path('/patterns/british-sign-language.html') %>">British Sign Language</a></li></ul></article>
</section>
<section class="c-home-band"><div class="c-container c-home-columns"><div><h2>A separate identity, shared principles</h2><p>civica.uk uses its own supplied identity. GOV.UK, NHS, Ministry of Justice, DWP, Home Office and ONS guidance inform the system; their official brands do not appear in the interface.</p><a href="<%= docs_path('/styles/brand.html') %>">Use the civica.uk brand</a></div><div><h2>Know what is implemented</h2><p>A reference example describes a design. A theme changes appearance. The optional companion adds specific interactions. Each has a different scope.</p><a href="<%= docs_path('/get-started/compatibility.html') %>">Check compatibility and limits</a></div></div></section>
<section class="c-container c-home-columns c-home-support"><div><h2>Design for everyone</h2><p>Build around readable content, keyboard access, clear focus, useful labels and alternatives to visual information.</p><a href="<%= docs_path('/accessibility/index.html') %>">Accessibility principles and checks</a></div><div><h2>Help improve the system</h2><p>Share evidence from real household tasks. Document differences, test examples and keep guidance connected to the implementation.</p><a href="<%= docs_path('/community/index.html') %>">Contribute to civica.uk</a></div></section>
